a&_nc_ohc=W44ZvqmjM3sQ7kNvwFIzZwB&_nc_oc=Adpx-YTotffAnC4tSZqrml6NE_n4Vnfa22FB8DzCwO3T__WwXFWh8EL0N1xU8K4FXJM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOmw3dUwTTz4abMyFSZrDxbU07vuwxHijsxe5LhQ4-9Mg&oe=6AC3B7C6"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_007_0003.png", "id": "845763184505694", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828050_845763187839027_468447991220621964_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sNbLawxDRSgQ7kNvwFTOQhM&_nc_oc=AdqffaI6qFiQ09IAjDspBG4ojOIawzclo9456I_AowLIHiMIHgO2LeM6knYPI7i4_84&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPqvXhtlE4X_takaaKmaMVICOpRGW1H0Df2JEalgwMWQA&oe=6AC3A52C"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_003_0002.png", "id": "1836602476962685", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820855_1836602480296018_8280261062432359374_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gUagQm5S3x4Q7kNvwFkUCJc&_nc_oc=AdpXrfaXG6de2t7saYclnuAlPsDJEvGfgBGn6h3zy4fPYFUPtU3oOL7jZ3m-trLkHNI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN7RpQqIpmhjpSogVQosf5nY3_y7S2s9dhaiH-eKdpEQQ&oe=6AC3DA43"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_004_0000.png", "id": "1138993271704566", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823783_1138993275037899_3311993198849045458_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MO-s16bL6kMQ7kNvwFzvIZj&_nc_oc=AdqJMU23yWWo35pJI35iiM_XgmjL85iUGcQQ0ubUO9Hlko-ERdZJYASKNCuJdy92jI4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPWcgvVkbP9WOIkA2ynbbK_VxRNl6bpFgF0mGCDmko5DQ&oe=6AC3A513"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_006_0001.png", "id": "847449181015275", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823279_847449184348608_15613528115627936_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z6O9_CUxHQ8Q7kNvwH0-rM6&_nc_oc=Adrs_ce5qR09kgG0w4RzoiUWWEBomfPGrPzjsbnhtXmxvYO5ZSOB8wvKi4_pkIci-Aw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNioilLSscGPy6kJFZf4VGv4Fvz2yerRHxBnhZpGiLMFQ&oe=6AC3D6C1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Zibby", "keywords": ["social", "casual", "free", "gorilla", "multiplayer"], "long_description": "# Welcome to Zibby!\n\nZibby is not just game. Zibby is lifestyle. Enter the world, be the Zibby.\n\n# Bonk & Snack\nSee that Spitflower? It has gems inside. BONK the Spitflower. Gem falls out? Don't put in pocket. EAT IT. Crunchy victory.\n\n{847821848000023}\n\n# Shop Like a Boss\nWhy look boring? Go to store. We have everything! Buy funny hat. Buy cool gadget. Buy shiny things. Look fresh, impress friends. Spend your hard-earned cash here.\n\n{1280599737210708}\n\n# Dig Deep, Eat Dark\nGrab pickaxe. Find rock. Smash rock! Oh look, coal pieces! Are you hungry? Yes. Eat the coal. Mining is tasty work.\n\n{2308405566240054}\n\n# Zoom and Boing\nWalking is for slow people. Use Jumppad: BOING! Fly high. Use Zipline: WHOOSH! Go fast. Explore the world like a pro. Never touch ground again.\n\n{722552094239314}\n\n# The Circle of Life\nSimple life. Good life. Walk -> Grab -> Bonk Mob -> EAT. Mine Rock -> Get Coal -> EAT. -> Sell loot -> Get rich -> Repeat. This is the Zibby way.\n\n{3001593293368798}\n\n**Rise through the skies. Serve the kingdom. Become Zibby.**\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Explore floating island biomes as Zibby, servant of the kingdom. Team up with friends to hunt monsters, mine rare resources, and uncover secrets across a vast sky-realm. Collect valuable drops, sell them in the castle safe zone, and upgrade your gear. New islands, enemies, and tools arrive with every update\u2014your adventure never stops!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://liminagames.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Limina Games", "support_website_url": "https://liminagames.com/discord", "website_url": "https://liminagames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST"